              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yonacan te gamo ni, “Pappa okelo ayela oko i lobo. Nen kite ame waŋa doŋ odoko atek kede pi bilo ka moo kic aduno. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mom onwoŋo twero bedo ber akato, kono ka ce tin jo onwoŋo ocamo gin ame gin oyako i baŋ okworgi kite ame yigi mito? Koŋ inen aman mom ru oneko jo Piriciti apol.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
