          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Caulo te kobbi Yonacan ni, “Kobba gin ame itimo.” Yonacan te cako titte kun kobo ni, “An abilo moo kic aduno kun agweto kede abiro ame onwoŋo tye i ciŋa. An gira doŋ ene, an abino to.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Caulo te kobo ni, “Obaŋa myero otim ginnoro arac meicel i koma, yin gire myero ito, Yonacan.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.44"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
